  "thig8.1:0.3": "Thig 8 Sīsūpacālā ",
  "thig8.1:1.1": "Sīsūpacālā:\nA nun, consummate in virtue, ",
  "thig8.1:1.2": "her faculties well-restrained, ",
  "thig8.1:1.3": "will reach the state of peace, ",
  "thig8.1:1.4": "a nourishment\nthat never cloys. ",
  "thig8.1:2.1": "Māra:\nThe Devas of the Thirty-three,\nthe Hours, ",
  "thig8.1:2.2": "the Contented, ",
  "thig8.1:2.3": "devas who delight in creation, ",
  "thig8.1:2.4": "& devas in control: ",
  "thig8.1:2.5": "Direct your mind there ",
  "thig8.1:2.6": "where you lived before. ",
  "thig8.1:3.1": "Sīsūpacālā:\nThe Devas of the Thirty-three,\nthe Hours, ",
  "thig8.1:3.2": "the Contented, ",
  "thig8.1:3.3": "devas who delight in creation, ",
  "thig8.1:3.4": "& devas in control: ",
  "thig8.1:4.1": "Time & again,\nfrom becoming to becoming, ",
  "thig8.1:4.2": "surrounded by self-identity, ",
  "thig8.1:4.3": "not having gone beyond self-identity, ",
  "thig8.1:4.4": "they flow to birth & death. ",
  "thig8.1:5.1": "The whole world is burning. ",
  "thig8.1:5.2": "The whole world is aflame. ",
  "thig8.1:5.3": "The whole world is blazing. ",
  "thig8.1:5.4": "The whole world is shaken. ",
  "thig8.1:6.1": "The unshaken, incomparable ",
  "thig8.1:6.2": "—the Dhamma the Buddha taught to me, ",
  "thig8.1:6.3": "of which people run-of-the-mill\ndon’t partake— ",
  "thig8.1:6.4": "that’s where my heart\ntruly delights. ",
  "thig8.1:7.1": "Having heard his words, ",
  "thig8.1:7.2": "I dwell, delighting\nin his bidding. ",
  "thig8.1:7.3": "The three knowledges\nare attained; ",
  "thig8.1:7.4": "the Buddha’s bidding,\ndone. ",
  "thig8.1:8.1": "Everywhere enjoyment\nis defeated; ",
  "thig8.1:8.2": "the mass of darkness,\nburst. ",
  "thig8.1:8.3": "So know, Evil One, ",
  "thig8.1:8.4": "that you have been,\nEnd-maker,\nstruck down. ",
  "thig8.1:9.1": "",
  "thig8.1:10.1": ""
}
